{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc 'cat round46x-brief.md; ls gate-run20*; tail -18 mutants.log'","aggregated_output":"# Council round 46x: after 46w (read-only, same thread)\n\n46w answered: a sum's or roll_forward's repeated operands are netted by figure id before values and bounds are computed, in the check and in every recomputation (_terms). R2rev: a bounded commitment booked and fully reversed passes, with the alternate 28.5 exact. R2m stays refused (two distinct opposing bounds). G4x2 adds two distinct figures with one derivation (a - b), which netting cannot see and C9's one-point sensitivity refuses.\n\nGate run 20: 74 of 74. Mutants: 38 of 38 caught. render-r1 clean.\n\nAnswer GATE PASS STANDS or GATE FAIL, sorting any finding as (A) blocking or (B) a relabelling for the blind readers. Only (A) blocks. If no (A) remains, say GATE PASS STANDS.\ngate-run20.fixtures.json\ngate-run20.txt\nminus sign ignored in bounds | R2b2b | CAUGHT (['R2b2a', 'R2b2b'])\noverlap alternate drops bounds | R2b1 | CAUGHT (['R2b1'])\nopposing bounds merged | R2m | CAUGHT (['R2m'])\nrepeated operands not netted | R2rev | CAUGHT (['R2rev'])\nC3 off | R1a | CAUGHT (['R1a', 'R1qb'])\ncrossings ignore open ends | R4b3 | CAUGHT (['R4b3', 'R4one'])\nC3 bounds use paired ends | R1qc | CAUGHT (['R1qc'])\nC3 impossibility ignores open ends | R1qb | CAUGHT (['R1qb'])\nbounds dropped in recomputation | R4one | CAUGHT (['R4one'])\nC1 accepts any substring (alone) | T9 | CAUGHT (['T9'])\nC5 allows estimates | P3b | CAUGHT (['P3b'])\nper-unit identity ignores scope | P4 | CAUGHT (['P4'])\nper-unit inverse loses its scale | G3inv | CAUGHT (['G3inv'])\nC2 tolerance 50% | P2 | CAUGHT (['P2', 'U2'])\nbound direction ignored | R4m | CAUGHT (['R2b2b', 'R4m'])\nC9 same base off (both clauses) | G4m | CAUGHT (['G24m', 'G24d', 'G24c', 'G24x', 'G4x', 'G4x2', 'G4c', 'G4m'])\nC10 prior not authenticated | P3c | CAUGHT (['P3c'])\nAll rules have a mutant; none is left unexercised.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
